# Folders whose changes need the owner's approval. Agents act through the owner's account, so
# approval is given with the `owner-approved` label, enforced by a required check (issue M0-01).
# This file is the list that check reads. Only changes to or deletions of existing files here
# need approval; new files don't (except in docs/specs/, where everything does).
# OWNER_USERNAME is replaced during setup (setup/KICKOFF.md, step 5).
/tests/        @lourencovp
**/tests/      @lourencovp
/references/   @lourencovp
/goldens/      @lourencovp
/docs/specs/   @lourencovp
/.github/CODEOWNERS @lourencovp
